    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__QuoteLine__c records where NetTotal differs materially from NetPrice × Quantity.
Why it matters: The math is broken — usually a price rule overwrote one field without recalculating the other. The invoice will show one amount, the quote PDF another, and the customer catches the inconsistency.
Suppress a finding: when manual NetTotal overrides are explicitly allowed in your business model.
Disable the detector: only if intentional discrepancies are normal. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
